commit 8144f0db8e2f5365c5a4bfab7fb5e4e43ea5e28b
Author: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 10 04:19:38 2026 +0000

    feat!: disable the in-app updater entirely
    
    Product decision (supersedes backlog S6/S7/D3). Removes the update check,
    download, install/replace, the update_check/update_auto/update_notify
    settings, OMSI_NO_UPDATE/OMSI_UPDATE_URL, the launcher update dialog,
    banner and Settings section, the navigator update card, the Android
    PackageInstaller hand-over (INSTALL_STATUS handler, REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES)
    and the related translations and docs. The version and a static, validated
    link to the repository's releases page (opened only on click) remain.
    Registry: docs/removed/UPDATER_DISABLED.md.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FZQVQ3tmYW219vn9Z5vh6F

